    394  3d44							; ADVANCED SOUND values (the menu's choices index these). SID vibrato depth
    395  3d44							; x 1/4096 of the frequency (61 = 1/4 semitone), rate x 1/262 Hz, delay in
    396  3d44							; 4 ms; glide 1/2^k of the way per 4 ms; tremolo depth of 15, rate x 1/655
    397  3d44							; Hz; SID detune (8 = FAT's, about 7 cents); Game Boy warble.
