    362  69bd							; ------------------------------------------------------------ One Key Play
    363  69bd							; CRSR DOWN or CRSR RIGHT (A = 1 / 2: which) pressed, ONE KEY PLAY on: the
    364  69bd							; phrase's next step sounds. PENTATONIC PAIRS: two notes of the key's
    365  69bd							; pentatonic scale, one apart (a third or a fourth), across the overlay's two
    366  69bd							; octaves. CHORD NOTES: one note of the chord (the keys held or latched),
    367  69bd							; over two octaves. EACH PRESS CUTS the last step or lets it RING ON (until
